# The local screen (ADR-033): Kura Desktop on the machine's own display.
# Only in a PC image built with OS_KIOSK="true"; never on the Raspberry Pi.
# cage is a compositor for one full-screen program; cog is a small browser.
cage
cog
# Drivers for the screen, and a font for the browser's own pages
libgl1-mesa-dri
fonts-inter
